ChargePolicy.c/.h (the charging policy, backlog B4) and ChargeLink.h (its wiring into the codec, piano-power-policy=1) are new code
(BSD-2-Clause-Patent), written fresh: the behaviour and numbers from docs/ubuntu-history/device.md and kernel.md and the GPL
